  "description": "Aoling, busy eating and drinking recklessly in Tokyo. Feeling ashamed of my weight-gaining self-pity, I decide to join a fasting center... but upon further investigation, I discover that the Jeju Island fasting center offers healing and weight loss! Dreaming of killing two birds with one stone—travel and diet—I head to Jeju. There, I meet diverse people and discover a side of Jeju I'd never known before... Will I truly be able to lose weight? Always busy touring famous tourist spots and eating and drinking, can I truly discover Jeju through a different lens?\n\nAoling, a reckless housewife, shares her diet and Jeju conquest story! Stay tuned!\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
